# 4.7 Alert documentation / runbook

Recommended alert documentation:

```text
Google Cloud Ops Agent telemetry has not been received from the affected
MFT VM for at least 5 minutes.

Investigation:

1. Check the parent Ops Agent service:

   sudo systemctl status google-cloud-ops-agent --no-pager

2. Check the Metrics Agent:

   sudo systemctl status \
     google-cloud-ops-agent-opentelemetry-collector \
     --no-pager

3. Check the Logging Agent:

   sudo systemctl status \
     google-cloud-ops-agent-fluent-bit \
     --no-pager

4. Review recent Ops Agent logs:

   sudo journalctl \
     -u 'google-cloud-ops-agent*' \
     --since "30 minutes ago" \
     --no-pager

5. Look for errors:

   sudo journalctl \
     -u 'google-cloud-ops-agent*' \
     --since "30 minutes ago" \
     --no-pager \
     | grep -Ei 'error|failed|warn|retry|permission|403'

6. If required, restart the Ops Agent:

   sudo systemctl restart google-cloud-ops-agent

7. Verify the services return to active/running.

8. Confirm agent.googleapis.com/agent/uptime resumes in Cloud Monitoring.
```

